WEBVTT

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:15.190
Turn here! Over here too!

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:16.580
Here too!

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:22.210
Honoka-chan, how are we going to steal something this big?

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:23.830
Security is lax.

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:27.580
Akiha, get the crowd's attention at Point B.

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:29.090
Getting their attention...

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:31.900
Like this?

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:33.220
Do it seriously!

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:37.930
Geez, do you start fooling around every time I stop watching you?

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:39.470
And what about you?

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:42.100
Don't play around with my computer!

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.180
Be quiet, you withered leaf!

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:45.160
TL Note: Kareha, withered leaf, is a play on Akiha, autumn leaf.

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:47.590
Why you, I'll really tell the ICP this time!

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:48.960
It can't be helped...

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:54.800
Ouch...

00:00:57.210 --> 00:00:58.070
Don't!

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:05.630
There wasn't a need for me to distract them from the start, was there?

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:08.250
Hmph, like I have time to babysit you people.

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:12.790
I am now surfing the suave Internet.

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:15.850
Oh... I need to check how infamous I am.

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:18.040
Keyword: Leopard.

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:19.760
What the?!

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:22.970
This won't do...

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:31.030
Flying through space, freely, gracefully

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:31.030
sora wo kakeru jiyuu ni yuuga ni

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:34.730
On the shoulders and in the heart, the girl has wings

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:34.730
kata ni mo kokoro ni mo shoujo wa hane o motsu

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:38.420
The world she was born into is beautiful

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:38.420
umare ochita sekai wa utsukushi

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:42.070
Even a goddess cannot rule

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:42.070
megami sae shihai dekinai

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:49.480
That dream on a star born in darkness,

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:49.480
yume wa ankoku ni umerareta hoshi de

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:52.380
it won't shine by just watching.

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:52.380
miteru dake jya kagayakazu

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:56.840
My body becomes a spaceship,

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:56.840
watashi no karada wa uchuusen to nari

00:01:56.240 --> 00:02:00.100
and climbs to the atmosphere of my thoughts

00:01:56.240 --> 00:02:00.100
shikou no taiki wo nobotte hatesou

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:14.860
If I try to resign to calmness, my heart will bug up.

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:14.860
heion ni amanjitara haato ga bagu okosu

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:18.580
Hey, with your rocket,

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:18.580
nee anata no roketto de

00:02:18.190 --> 00:02:22.020
can you change my path?

00:02:18.190 --> 00:02:22.020
kidou shuusei shite kudasaru

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:25.950
By being connected together, we confirm

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:25.950
tsunagatte tashikameau

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:31.490
we aren't androids

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:31.490
watashi-tachi andoroido jyanai mono

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:35.440
Across the rainbow, to the future to someone

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:35.440
niji wo kakeru ashita he dare ka he

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:39.160
If wishing will get me there, I will gradually start believing

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:39.160
negae ba todoku to sukoshi zutsu shinjiteru

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:42.820
The world we march into is limitless

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:42.820
susunde yuku sekai wa hatenai

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:46.490
Even God cannot destroy it all

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:46.490
kami ni sae hakai dekinai

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:51.630
And one day even the sins people made will disappear

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:51.630
hito ga kakaeta tsumi mo itsuka kiete

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:59.050
Those Who Do Not Obey

00:02:55.770 --> 00:03:00.600
Because Investigator Itsuki Kannagi from the Paranormal Department infiltrated this unknown structure,

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:04.510
the identity of the suspect has been confirmed from the image she took.

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:09.810
Second year student at the highly prestigious Surre Academy: Shishidou Akiha.

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:12.060
Same age as us...

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:13.680
Arrest and interrogate her?

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:17.570
Honestly, how can you say such politically dangerous things while in the police force.

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:25.200
She is linked to the extremely renowned Shishidou Corporation which has great financial influence.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.350
Organization?

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:29.010
So if we catch her, we'll become heroes, right?

00:03:29.010 --> 00:03:30.180
Fools!

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:34.080
Two dumb girls who don't know the workings of the adult world.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:40.340
To the Shishidou family, erasing nosy police officers is the same as having breakfast.

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:45.100
And there isn't a need to mention that you useless ninjas would be, like the wind...

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:48.470
Sign: Life

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:50.430
Really!?!

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:54.250
This is a delicate matter.

00:03:54.250 --> 00:04:00.690
Thus, the investigation of the unknown structure will be done in secret.

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:06.910
You've witnessed the late Kannagi investigating this matter,

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:08.680
the same fate awaits you two.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:12.390
So give in. Otherwise, like the wind...

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:14.920
So... Hurry up and scram!

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:16.850
Y-Yes!

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:21.920
Got to let Ul and Itsuki-kun, in heaven, know.

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:24.930
Bougainvillea and Mintao.

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:26.910
Ninjas from the public safety division.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:28.630
They came to your funeral.

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:32.290
The duo who was tailing me.

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:33.680
How's your investigation coming?

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:37.910
There seems to be no change in the way Shishidou Akiha acts towards me.

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:39.810
Even though she knows who I really am...

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:43.280
Maybe it's because she's a lady, that's why she's a little thick.

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:44.690
Putting that aside,

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:48.790
it looks really bustling today.

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:51.240
Sign: Sponsored by Shishidou Corporation

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:50.500
It's because of the school festival.

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:52.140
Are you also coming, Ul?

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:55.290
What about you? You should enjoy yourself at this kind of event.

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:01.400
I wonder where Honoka-chan went...

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:04.230
It would be nice if she didn't do anything out of the ordinary again...

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:05.700
Ojou-sama!

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:09.970
Imo-chan.

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:11.660
I was searching for you...

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:15.100
What is your class doing again?

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:17.850
We are doing a transportation cafe.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.360
That's awesome.

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:25.730
That's because guidance robots love transportation machines.

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:29.120
Kazane-sama helped us out a lot too.

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:35.830
Isn't that a two-cycle trunk engine?

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.430
Awesome...

00:05:37.430 --> 00:05:39.720
Just how did they get one?

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:44.370
Every member of the Shishidou family has attended this academy.

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:46.610
They probably just used their connections to get one.

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:52.190
Shishidou Akiha.

00:05:52.190 --> 00:05:57.750
Shishidou Akiha from 2-C, please head to the Director's office now.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:05:59.800
I wonder what happened.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:00.770
Who knows.

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:08.560
Tomorrow I am going to retake an important possession from this famous school colony.

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:10.360
Look forward to it...

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:16.250
Er... You foolish human beings!

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:21.070
The school mainframe received that mail this morning.

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:25.150
After checking the source of the mail, it was from your terminal.

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:27.060
But that...

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:30.300
We aren't accusing you of doing this,

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:33.470
but we believe you may have been hacked.

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:35.220
Where is your computer right now?

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:39.750
Umm... My friend has it right now...

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.230
I know about that too.

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:44.050
It'll be better if we contact the ICP.

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:45.830
It's probably a bad joke.

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:50.780
Besides, if we were to contact the police, your older sister Kazane would get angry, right?

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:52.270
We can't let that happen.

00:06:52.270 --> 00:06:56.370
S-Sorry. I'll try to do something about it...

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:07.380
Shimoyama-san.

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:15.470
Next station ahead is Leopard! Leopard ahead!

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:18.010
You stupid Leopard!

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:19.920
What?

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:21.870
What are you doing?

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:25.400
A disguise is the first step towards becoming a mastermind.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:26.770
You idiot!

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:28.220
What are you doing!

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:29.860
That's my line!

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:31.900
What's with that declaration?

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:35.620
This is to expose the ignorant world to my greatness.

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:37.940
What are you going to do if your identity is revealed?

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:42.150
I have installed the Internet and now I know...

00:07:42.150 --> 00:07:42.930
Huh?

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:46.710
If I stay and rot here, I'll never become big!

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:48.210
Look at this.

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:51.010
Look? Isn't that mine?

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:55.580
This is all I get from searching Leopard.

00:07:55.580 --> 00:08:00.330
Woah... This is our class café and it's already on the net!

00:08:01.570 --> 00:08:05.920
Playing with outdated earth vehicles is so popular they get all the hits.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:09.050
And yet I, a Super Technology A.I., am disregarded!

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:12.990
You never announced yourself to the world, did you?

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:17.510
How dare you say something like that!

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:18.620
It's the truth, right?

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:21.910
I'm confiscating this.

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:26.370
And anyway, can't you surf the net by yourself?

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:29.680
Don't put me and the computer on the same level.

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:34.640
In order to protect my precious soul, I usually do not go out.

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:36.510
You mean you're a hikikomori?

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:37.740
Shut up, number two.

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:40.530
You said number two didn't you?!

00:08:40.530 --> 00:08:43.270
Anyway, you should know...

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:47.900
Since that declaration has already been sent, you guys will have to take the mission.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:53.190
Go into the school colony and retrieve this.

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:55.150
It's something I must have.

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:57.390
It's about time I made it clear.

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:59.660
I'm not your servant.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:04.070
Whatever you do next time, you have to get our approval first.

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:04.730
Understand?

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:07.460
I won't listen to the words from withered leaf and number two.

00:09:07.460 --> 00:09:11.420
In short, you want to get shot down by my verbal machine gun again?

00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:12.750
Not really...

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:18.650
Barbecue meat is being cooked right here! It's nicely cooked!

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:20.830
It's delicious, definitely good!

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:23.260
Shimoyama-san, you're a life-saver.

00:09:23.850 --> 00:09:24.720
Thanks.

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:26.490
For helping me out on such short notice.

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:28.080
It's okay.

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:31.730
You're really no good at evading these things.

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:33.700
I accepted without thinking.

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:36.090
I am incompetent.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:39.710
But it's my policy to do things properly!

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:42.280
And what about that outfit?

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:44.780
Anyway, be on watch.

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:49.160
Since that declaration was sent, Shishidou Akiha will definitely take action.

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:50.500
Two sticks, if you may.

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:51.790
Ok. Right away.

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:55.200
It sure is peaceful.

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:58.810
This is so different from our hectic life.

00:09:58.810 --> 00:09:59.700
That's true.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.140
If we don't find that Shishidou girl,

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:04.360
our lives will just blow away, Min-chan.

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:06.700
Hey you.

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:07.770
Me?

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:12.470
Yes, you. Tell us about Shishidou Akiha.

00:10:12.470 --> 00:10:13.870
I don't know her.

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:15.270
Please ask someone else.

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:19.820
That's cold. Even though we're both in the same school.

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:21.240
Thanks for your patronage.

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:22.920
It's really good, Min-chan.

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:25.080
Thanks, Bou.

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:28.120
By the way, have we met somewhere before?

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:31.240
N-No, never before.

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:35.650
Ah, but I feel like I know you from somewhere.

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:47.260
What happened?

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:53.060
There is a student going berserk at the 405th school arranged special zone.

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:54.730
We can't hold him down.

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:56.040
Help them...

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:58.460
Fight. At 405 right?

00:10:58.460 --> 00:10:59.610
Understood.

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:05.160
Hey!

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:07.250
And off she goes.

00:11:09.610 --> 00:11:10.860
Did you see that?

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:12.750
Isn't that... It can't be...

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:15.510
Kannagi!

00:11:15.510 --> 00:11:18.250
She's back from the dead!

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:19.980
That's no good.

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:23.550
Ignore the warnings, and proceed with the retrieval.

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:25.580
But...

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:28.640
Attempting to dissuade our King is unforgivable.

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:31.850
Hold on... Hello?

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:34.380
Geez, what's with her...

00:11:57.060 --> 00:11:58.050
Seven colors.

00:11:58.050 --> 00:11:59.880
Let everything be stained with seven colors.

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:02.340
This is...

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:03.840
Is that red?

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:06.220
Red means blood. Die!

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:09.060
This power is...

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:13.060
Stain it. Let the world be stained by the seven colors!

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:20.200
Sorry. The street was blocked.

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:22.690
It seems we were late.

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:26.780
Is that so... To the guy wearing the box, don't think badly of me.

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:30.330
Authority? Authority? Authority is it?!

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:37.090
This is a nice view.

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:41.680
Impure relationships...

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:50.560
It's better to stop in front there.

00:12:50.560 --> 00:12:53.350
It's because it's the school's arranged special zone.

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:55.500
Arranged special zone?

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:56.470
Yeah.

00:12:56.470 --> 00:13:00.980
It's a place for students who hate the current education system to gather.

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:05.110
During the entrance ceremony, I heard about it a little.

00:13:05.110 --> 00:13:09.950
You, as a daughter of the Shishidou Corporation, and I, as the Director's younger brother,

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:12.230
can easily become targets of hatred.

00:13:12.230 --> 00:13:14.170
It's better not to get close.

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:16.510
But Honoka-chan is...

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:20.400
Imo-chan!

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:21.920
I'm breaking through!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:29.680
Stab you. I'll cut you all up.

00:13:35.050 --> 00:13:36.150
The sky...

00:13:36.150 --> 00:13:38.690
The sky is filled with darkness...

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:43.690
E-Excuse me!

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:47.380
If I can count on that kind of discourtesy, I'll be ready for you anytime.

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:01.750
That power.

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:06.070
She's capable of using it without the X-QT.

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:12.230
A flat level QT user, like me, needs a marking to use that.

00:14:12.230 --> 00:14:13.010
Why?

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:17.600
Shishidou Akiha was able to control the QT-Arms in the middle of battle.

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:20.350
And that guy just now...

00:14:21.030 --> 00:14:22.540
That form.

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:44.550
Itsuki.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:46.640
Ul.

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:49.790
Why you! Running off alone...

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:53.520
You don't have any authority as a police officer right now.

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:54.970
That's right.

00:14:54.970 --> 00:14:57.580
I forgot that I died.

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.120
I am incompetent.

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:01.140
Hearing you say it out loud like that sure sounds weird.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:03.210
So, what happened?

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:05.860
Ul, another X-QT!

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:11.290
X-QT, an X-QT with a box on his head, along with the previous X-QT student...

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:13.640
It went like that?

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:15.140
Well whatever.

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:17.500
For now, regain your composure.

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:18.790
Yes, Ul.

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:20.480
We will discuss it later.

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:26.710
You...

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:30.310
Hello, Shimoyama-san.

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:31.780
It's Kannagi.

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.630
I'm Kannagi Itsuki.

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:36.720
I... Besides...

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:38.810
Who are you exactly?

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:39.980
Who are you!

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:44.200
Why is it that the QT-Arms, brain colony, the antimatter cannon, and I...

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:46.220
and I...

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:49.890
Just forget about it for now...

00:15:49.890 --> 00:15:51.760
I remembered.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:55.240
Erm... You're the ICP from before... right?

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:56.930
That one time...

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:59.320
So it was true...

00:15:59.320 --> 00:16:02.160
And I was thinking we had met before...

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:04.200
I wonder why I couldn't remember.

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:06.540
You just realized?

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:09.200
Seriously... the both of you...

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:13.380
A-Anyway, I have a mountain of questions for you.

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:17.450
Why... bondage?

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:27.210
No.

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:29.930
Isn't this a good opportunity?

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:32.470
People go to school festivals to enjoy themselves, right?

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:38.050
If you feel uneasy come back quickly.

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:40.110
I won't go in the first place.

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:49.170
It seems like it's getting more and more complicated.

00:16:58.100 --> 00:17:02.040
Now that the Internet has been taken, I have nothing to do!

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.100
And this is too weird.

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:07.240
Why do I have to listen to them?!

00:17:07.240 --> 00:17:10.600
Aren't withered leaf and number two supposed to be my servants?!

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:15.050
I need to remind them who's boss...

00:17:16.330 --> 00:17:17.800
Eh? Ship show?

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:21.410
To tell you the truth, the advertisements aren't having much effect.

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:22.310
It can't be..

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:24.400
It's supposed to be a normal class event, right?

00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:26.100
Asking about the school festival...

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:30.460
If it were a worthless normal class event, it wouldn't require so much work, right?

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:31.510
Not again...

00:17:31.510 --> 00:17:35.430
Wasn't Surre Academy always on bad terms with the Shishidou family?

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:37.660
Don't say anything misleading.

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:41.660
If you're going to say that, Akiha-chan might hate it.

00:17:42.350 --> 00:17:45.040
About Akiha, you helped a lot.

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:46.880
I guess so.

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:48.900
She has just started running.

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:51.350
We can't let her get stuck so soon right?

00:17:56.260 --> 00:18:00.260
To think that the parts were here all along...

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:02.860
Positron Matrix.

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:04.830
Leopard needs it.

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:07.530
Akiha, go to the storage room upstairs.

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:09.270
Honoka-chan?

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:10.930
We will split up.

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:13.900
W-Wait...

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:17.370
Ojou-sama, are you all right?

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:20.430
I'm sorry for making you accompany me.

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:23.470
It's nothing. I will protect Ojou-sama.

00:18:26.720 --> 00:18:28.740
A reaction from the Q-Tector.

00:18:28.740 --> 00:18:29.880
Let's go.

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:31.770
Yes, Ul.

00:18:42.410 --> 00:18:43.180
That's it.

00:18:43.820 --> 00:18:48.140
Is it E-3? I think it might be this.

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:50.550
This time we're lucky too...

00:18:57.320 --> 00:19:01.180
Shishidou Akiha, we're arresting you on theft charges.

00:19:01.180 --> 00:19:03.420
Um... Shimoyama-san...

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:04.740
It's Kannagi.

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:10.360
Former ICP Paranormal Department staff member, Kannagi Itsuki.

00:19:10.360 --> 00:19:13.260
Um... right...

00:19:13.260 --> 00:19:15.170
I... Um...

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:19.710
Who's that?

00:19:19.710 --> 00:19:21.000
Leopard?

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:23.790
Withered leaf! Over here.

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:25.110
What are you looking at, idiot?

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:27.890
You. What are you up to?

00:19:28.320 --> 00:19:32.430
I thought it was time to make it clear who was in charge here.

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:34.640
Ha? Are you stupid?

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:36.620
Saying that in this situation-

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:42.340
Are you speechless?

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:45.530
I have infiltrated the suit's control.

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:47.920
Don't kid me! You stupid Leopard!

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:50.890
St- What did you say! You withered leaf!

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:56.450
You're being stripped bare!

00:19:57.350 --> 00:19:59.940
I have prepared for a situation of this level.

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:05.150
Even I am...

00:20:05.150 --> 00:20:06.430
The keys to the handcuffs...

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:09.080
Hey!

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:13.620
Looks like your suit is being affected through the handcuffs.

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:15.110
This kind of thing...

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:21.300
If you want me to stop, you better start accepting it now...

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:24.200
That I am the strongest, and you are my servants.

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:27.530
And. What's your answer?!

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:33.020
A women-hater like you can never be forgiven!

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:34.080
Let's escape.

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:39.530
Mr. Policeman, please get the key to the handcuffs.

00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:42.780
I'll help Ojou-sama escape.

00:20:42.780 --> 00:20:44.650
I-I understand.

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:47.100
To be ordered around by a mere civilian...

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:53.460
Why is the school still so crowded?

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:55.450
If this goes on, it won't be good.

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:03.270
Are you still going to resist me?

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:04.960
Over here.

00:21:13.470 --> 00:21:15.440
Wearing clothes on the outside eh?

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:17.350
Even this kind of situation is within my predictions.

00:21:18.030 --> 00:21:19.520
Disassembling!

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:36.900
I hope no one notices us.

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:39.110
Just joking...

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:41.910
Hope no one notices us...

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:49.660
Imo-chan...

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:52.780
I made it.

00:21:52.780 --> 00:21:55.220
(They say dock, but to be accurate, it should be hangar)

00:21:52.780 --> 00:21:55.160
If we keep turning, we can reach the hangar.

00:22:02.100 --> 00:22:04.360
Imo-chan!

00:22:08.480 --> 00:22:10.200
His strip down was just one use only, huh?

00:22:10.200 --> 00:22:12.410
That Leopard...

00:22:12.410 --> 00:22:16.200
Let's get changed and go to him. It won't end like this.

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:16.680
Yeah.

00:22:26.790 --> 00:22:29.370
Mission complete.

